    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Israel’s Unfaithfulness to God"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hallelujah!",
          "Give thanks to the Lord, for he is good;",
          "his faithful love endures forever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Who can declare the Lord’s mighty acts",
          "or proclaim all the praise due him?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How happy are those who uphold justice,",
          "who practice righteousness at all times."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Remember me, Lord,",
          "when you show favor to your people.",
          "Come to me with your salvation"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "so that I may enjoy the prosperity",
          "of your chosen ones,",
          "rejoice in the joy of your nation,",
          "and boast about your heritage."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Both we and our ancestors have sinned;",
          "we have done wrong and have acted wickedly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our ancestors in Egypt did not grasp",
          "the significance of your wondrous works",
          "or remember your many acts of faithful love;",
          "instead, they rebelled by the sea #— #the Red Sea."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Yet he saved them for his name’s sake,",
          "to make his power known."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He rebuked the Red Sea, and it dried up;",
          "he led them through the depths as through a desert."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He saved them from the power of the adversary;",
          "he redeemed them from the power of the enemy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Water covered their foes;",
          "not one of them remained."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then they believed his promises",
          "and sang his praise."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They soon forgot his works",
          "and would not wait for his counsel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They were seized with craving in the wilderness",
          "and tested God in the desert."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He gave them what they asked for,",
          "but sent a wasting disease among them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In the camp they were envious of Moses",
          "and of Aaron, the Lord’s holy one."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The earth opened up and swallowed Dathan;",
          "it covered the assembly of Abiram."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Fire blazed throughout their assembly;",
          "flames consumed the wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "At Horeb they made a calf",
          "and worshiped the cast metal image."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They exchanged their glory ,",
          "for the image of a grass-eating ox."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They forgot God their Savior,",
          "who did great things in Egypt,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "wondrous works in the land of Ham,",
          "awe-inspiring acts at the Red Sea."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So he said he would have destroyed them —",
          "if Moses his chosen one",
          "had not stood before him in the breach",
          "to turn his wrath away from destroying them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They despised the pleasant land",
          "and did not believe his promise."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They grumbled in their tents",
          "and did not listen to the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So he raised his hand against them with an oath",
          "that he would make them fall in the desert"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and would disperse their descendants",
          "among the nations,",
          "scattering them throughout the lands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They aligned themselves with Baal of Peor",
          "and ate sacrifices offered to lifeless gods. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They angered the Lord with their deeds,",
          "and a plague broke out against them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But Phinehas stood up and intervened,",
          "and the plague was stopped."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It was credited to him as righteousness",
          "throughout all generations to come."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They angered the Lord at the Waters of Meribah,",
          "and Moses suffered because of them,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for they embittered his spirit,",
          "and he spoke rashly with his lips."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They did not destroy the peoples",
          "as the Lord had commanded them"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "but mingled with the nations",
          "and adopted their ways."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They served their idols,",
          "which became a snare to them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They sacrificed their sons and daughters to demons."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They shed innocent blood —",
          "the blood of their sons and daughters",
          "whom they sacrificed to the idols of Canaan;",
          "so the land became polluted with blood."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They defiled themselves by their actions",
          "and prostituted themselves by their deeds."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Therefore the Lord’s anger burned against his people,",
          "and he abhorred his own inheritance."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          41
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He handed them over to the nations;",
          "those who hated them ruled over them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          42
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Their enemies oppressed them,",
          "and they were subdued under their power."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          43
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He rescued them many times,",
          "but they continued to rebel deliberately",
          "and were beaten down by their iniquity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          44
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When he heard their cry,",
          "he took note of their distress,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          45
        ],
        "lines": [
          "remembered his covenant with them,",
          "and relented according to the abundance",
          "of his faithful love."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          46
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He caused them to be pitied",
          "before all their captors."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          47
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Save us, Lord our God,",
          "and gather us from the nations,",
          "so that we may give thanks to your holy name",
          "and rejoice in your praise."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          48
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Blessed be the Lord God of Israel,",
          "from everlasting to everlasting.",
          "Let all the people say, “Amen! ”",
          "Hallelujah!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
